<h1>Domain Status Alert</h1>

<p>Hello <%= @user.email %>,</p>

<p>Your domain <%= @domain.name %> (<%= @domain.url %>) is currently experiencing downtime.</p>

<p>We detected that the domain has changed from operational status to down. Our system will continue monitoring the domain and notify you of any changes.</p>

<p>Please check your domain configuration and ensure everything is working as expected.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
Domain Checker System</p>